Source: { "Type":"Patch", "Feed":"WOSA Modernize", "Category":"Browser", "LastUpdated":"1785067200", "Title":"Open in Atlas (stock browser menu)", "FullDescription":"Keeps the stock web browser exactly as it is and adds an <b>Open in Atlas</b> item to its App Menu (tap the top-left corner of the screen). Choosing it hands the page you are on to Atlas (org.webosports.app.atlas), the modern WebKit browser, using the Palm application manager -- so you can start in the old browser and jump to Atlas only when a site needs it. The item is greyed out on the Start Page and in Preferences, where there is no page to hand over.<br><br>This is the gentle alternative to <i>Make Atlas the default browser</i>, which redirects every browser launch to Atlas and hides the stock browser icon. Install one or the other, not both -- if that patch is already installed this one detects it and leaves the browser alone.<br><br>Self-contained (no AUSMT): the stock com.palm.app.browser index.html is backed up and restored on removal. Restart Luna (or relaunch the browser) to apply.", "MinWebOSVersion":"3.0.5", "MaxWebOSVersion":"3.9.9", "PostInstallFlags":"RestartLuna", "PostUpdateFlags":"RestartLuna", "PostRemoveFlags":"RestartLuna", "Icon":"http://stacks.webosarchive.org/feeds/modernize/ipkgs/assets/icons/atlas.png" }

