Source: { "Type":"OS Application", "Feed":"WOSA Modernize", "Category":"Synergy", "LastUpdated":"1787624000", "Title":"Synergy Shared Runtime", "FullDescription":"The engine every Synergy connector runs on: the imlibpurple transport with a modern libpurple backend, the cloud core that talks to the storage services, the OAuth sign-in app, and the QuickOffice / Photos / Document Viewer integration. Replaces the stock, long-dead imlibpurpleservice.<br><br>Part of <b>Synergy Revival</b>, which pulls this package in automatically -- install that rather than picking the pieces by hand. webOS 3.0.5 (TouchPad) only; webOS CE 3.1.0 has it built in.<br><br>Install through Preware, from this feed. WebOS Quick Install and a manual ipkg install skip the feed's device checks and the dependency chain.<br><br>Uninstalling does not put HP's original app back; the copy it replaced is kept as /media/cryptofs/core-apps-backup*.tar. <br><br><b>Repackaged by webOS Archive.</b> Upstream's install scripts wait on a service that is waiting on them, which hangs the install and the tablet UI with no error; some could also leave a core app missing, and uninstall did not restore the original. All fixed in this build and sent upstream. If an app ever goes missing, uninstall it and reboot -- webOS reinstalls its own copy.", "MinWebOSVersion":"3.0.5", "MaxWebOSVersion":"3.0.9", "PostInstallFlags":"RestartDevice", "PostUpdateFlags":"RestartDevice", "PostRemoveFlags":"RestartLuna" }

