Source: { "Type":"OS Application", "Feed":"WOSA Modernize", "Category":"Synergy", "LastUpdated":"1787624000", "Title":"Accounts (For Synergy Revival)", "FullDescription":"<b>Remove Accounts (Community Build) first.</b> This app supersedes org.webosarchive.accountsapp -- it is that same build plus the SYNERGY ACCOUNTS grouping, the Delete Account Data page, the deep link from Phone and the missing translations. Both replace /usr/palm/applications/com.palm.app.accounts and each keeps its own backup of what it found there, so if the old package is still installed when this one goes on, uninstalling it afterwards would restore the older app over this one. TLS 1.3 Updates 1.0.18 and Synergy Revival both repair that during install -- but removing the retired package first is cleaner.<br><br>The Accounts app: sign in to your community account, edit your name, email, password and public username, see the devices on the account and sign out, all from Settings &gt; Accounts. With Synergy Revival installed it also groups your Synergy accounts and offers Delete Account Data for accounts you have removed. This is the build shipped in the webOS CE 3.1.0 release candidate.<br><br>Part of <b>Synergy Revival</b>, which pulls this package in automatically -- install that rather than picking the pieces by hand. webOS 3.0.5 (TouchPad) only; webOS CE 3.1.0 has it built in.<br><br>Install through Preware, from this feed. WebOS Quick Install and a manual ipkg install skip the feed's device checks and the dependency chain.<br><br>Uninstalling does not put HP's original app back; the copy it replaced is kept as /media/cryptofs/core-apps-backup*.tar. <br><br><b>Repackaged by webOS Archive.</b> Upstream's install scripts wait on a service that is waiting on them, which hangs the install and the tablet UI with no error; some could also leave a core app missing, and uninstall did not restore the original. All fixed in this build and sent upstream. If an app ever goes missing, uninstall it and reboot -- webOS reinstalls its own copy.", "MinWebOSVersion":"3.0.5", "MaxWebOSVersion":"3.0.9", "PostInstallFlags":"RestartLuna", "PostUpdateFlags":"RestartLuna", "PostRemoveFlags":"RestartLuna", "Icon":"http://stacks.webosarchive.org/feeds/modernize/ipkgs/assets/icons/synergy/synergy-accounts.png" }

